[{"title":"次韵郑守舜举喜雪四首 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"湘吴醇酎惬兼衣，多病难禁玉斝飞。\n月下更期看国艳，凌波那更舞江妃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22754,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵郑守舜举喜雪四首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"银似豪家没奈何，玉成高垒更巍峨。\n残年共拟看三白，酌我从今未厌多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22755,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵郑守舜举喜雪四首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"使君仙骨迥无俦，合上琼楼倒玉舟。\n雪里渔蓑诗更好，盛传僧舍与歌楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22756,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵郑守舜举喜雪四首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"好雪相仍岁又除，丰年瑞事总堪书。\n未嫌款段追千骑，化作张仙跨白驴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22757,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春雪得小诗五首且约客登赏心亭 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"腊前未见梅如雪，春到还惊雪似梅。\n可是天公有情思，便令花树一时开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22758,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春雪得小诗五首且约客登赏心亭 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"淮南山色一千里，落水层城江更湍。\n何地江山有如许，与君聊趁雪中看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22759,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春雪得小诗五首且约客登赏心亭 其五","author":"韩元吉","text":"竹炉听雪坐蒲团，长笑诗人不耐寒。\n未办貂裘走南陌，肯来高处一凭栏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22760,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春雪得小诗五首且约客登赏心亭 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"东窗坐爱枝间雪，大似酴醾压架花。\n天气更晴宜有月，夜深来看玉交加。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22761,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春雪得小诗五首且约客登赏心亭 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"江南绝景赏心亭，卧雪难寻旧画屏。\n白鹭洲前夜来雪，故应此画胜丹青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22762,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵文鼎同游鹅石五首 其五","author":"韩元吉","text":"几年家住玉溪头，乘兴时来上钓舟。\n古寺幽情未曾到，寻春一为野僧留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22763,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵文鼎同游鹅石五首 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"潋潋烟波带月华，渡头江迥两三家。\n细倾社瓮鹅儿酒，共听山村杨白花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22764,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵文鼎同游鹅石五首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"长忆湖山天意新，诏恩大尹宴群臣。\n休寻辇毂纷华梦，且作林泉自在人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22765,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵文鼎同游鹅石五首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"桃花临水唤人看，花在嶙峋翠石间。\n莫惜持杯酬烂漫，更须扶杖俯潺湲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22766,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵赵文鼎同游鹅石五首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"缭绕云山溪水南，溪光溶漾滴晴岚。\n不知日暖花争艳，但觉风和酒易酣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22767,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行汴渠中","author":"韩元吉","text":"东海桑田未可期，隋河高岸已锄犁。\n楼船锦缆知无地，枯柳黄尘但古堤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22768,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖绝句戏题 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"流水当阶山对门，拟寻茅屋住荒村。\n谁怜九里松间路，犹有人间市井喧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22769,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖绝句戏题 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"浅白深红几树花，波光浮动竹交斜。\n怪来诗思清人骨，知是西湖处士家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22770,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖绝句戏题 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"人道西湖一曲屏，只应真色画难成。\n柳堤竹坞无穷意，更著荷花百媚生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22771,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访吴元鼎如村五首 其五","author":"韩元吉","text":"我生甲子幸君同，君自臞仙我秃翁。\n要拍铜鞮论岁月，莫嫌相对只诗穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22772,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访吴元鼎如村五首 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"昔年曾叹马相如，才气飘飘赋子虚。\n未怪家贫徒四壁，先生四壁僦人居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22773,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访吴元鼎如村五首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"经旬泥潦路难乾，烟袅长林雨暗山。\n常笑诗人愁屋漏，却思寒士与千间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22774,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访吴元鼎如村五首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"我住城南君在西，柴门草长与人齐。\n不妨共踏溪津路，日日云山入杖藜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22775,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访吴元鼎如村五首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"野竹漫山水漫门，未离城市却如村。\n何须更问柴桑陌，三径虽寒菊尚存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22776,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初见龟山塔","author":"韩元吉","text":"烟里微茫第一山，眼明白塔俯沧湾。\n尘埃满面三千里，一笑相看似梦间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22777,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庐山霁色","author":"韩元吉","text":"山北山南佛寺开，烟销日出更崔嵬。\n读书谁伴谪仙老，沽酒要须陶令来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22778,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵隐冷泉","author":"韩元吉","text":"山涵水影两空明，水到山前百尺清。\n洞里臞仙应一笑，抱琴时为写寒声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22779,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纸鸢","author":"韩元吉","text":"排风决起闹群儿，势力由来一线微。\n天上鹓鸾徒似耳，却惊遮日傍云飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22780,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧病","author":"韩元吉","text":"有身自觉皆为患，了事从来却号痴。\n贫里定知强健乐，未妨斗酒百篇诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22781,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏晴","author":"韩元吉","text":"愁眼东西万里情，山云斜度水风清。\n客行岁晚忽春尽，看到枯林绿叶成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22782,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿青阳旅舍起观林端积雪半消疑山矾盛开","author":"韩元吉","text":"风卷千林夜雪晴，九华山下月微明。\n不须更觅唐昌蕊，树树珑璁玉刻成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22783,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿斜溪闻杜鹃","author":"韩元吉","text":"解缆山衔日，移舟雨暗溪。\n无情子规鸟，梦断隔林啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22784,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜雪 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"炉火深红蜡炬明，打窗风雪正纵横。\n瓦瓶旋注山泉满，却作潇潇细雨声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22785,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜雪 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"伴眼文书细作行，昏昏愁卧雪穿廊。\n何人恰弄风前笛，错认梅花到枕傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22786,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明老惠炭戏以二小诗 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"雪里难逢送炭人，地炉炙手便生春。\n酸寒东野真堪笑，解道曲身成直身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22787,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明老惠炭戏以二小诗 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"道人作喜每逢场，一束乌薪发电光。\n便使樽前化红袖，不妨笑杀许旌阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22788,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昙花亭供茶戏作二首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"一声钟磬有无中，楼阁山林本自空。\n不向云端呈伎俩，犹来盏里现神通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22789,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昙花亭供茶戏作二首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"问讯高真此住家，伊蒲未办且煎茶。\n故应一笑来迎我，五百瓶中总是花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22790,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"武昌春色","author":"韩元吉","text":"樊山宫殿已成陈，烟雨阴晴到处春。\n花柳不知兴废事，隔江相倚斗时新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22791,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑守用前韵见示因亦和答四首 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"天巧由来不露机，冰澌剪出万花飞。\n琼珰似识汉川女，瑶瑟更逢湘浦妃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22792,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑守用前韵见示因亦和答四首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"振廪縻金气自和，政声谁为勒嵯峨。\n牛羊垄上饥民绝，鹅鸭池边勇士多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22793,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑守用前韵见示因亦和答四首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"九陌歌呼属后游，一蓑风景付渔舟。\n相逢且向南溪看，玉作灵山万石楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22794,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郑守用前韵见示因亦和答四首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"腊里三看雪满衢，使君当奉十行书。\n先生履敝人应笑，泥滑东家许借驴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22795,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钓台","author":"韩元吉","text":"璜溪亦有钓鱼人，一笑鹰扬扫战尘。\n不会先生辞汉祖，投竿深坐此江滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22796,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姜特立寄诗编为赋四首 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"宋景文为工学问，贺方回亦擅诗歌。\n半山人去东坡没，妙墨空嗟楯上磨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22797,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姜特立寄诗编为赋四首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"榕叶青青荔子红，三山十寺粤王宫。\n诵君好句浑如画，寄我清游梦想中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22798,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姜特立寄诗编为赋四首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"少年耽句千篇在，老境忘言半偈无。\n失喜因君还绝倒，但惊寒雀费隋珠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22799,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姜特立寄诗编为赋四首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"十载文场未奏功，鹖冠一笑且舂容。\n遥知横槊荻芦岸，海阔蛟鼍赴笔锋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22800,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日书事五首 其五","author":"韩元吉","text":"溪边乱石蛟鼍卧，烟里千花锦绣围。\n记得年时作寒食，山桥吹笛雨中归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22801,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日书事五首 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"忆上金华第一峰，相君官重酒樽同。\n梦寻绝壑谁重到，零落山桃小院风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22802,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日书事五首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"极目亭边花定开，野棠山杏手亲栽。\n春风拂槛知何似，应记刘郎两度来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22803,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日书事五首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"晓猿夜鹤寂无生，春至山禽百种鸣。\n步绕新泉聊洗耳，由来心与地俱清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22804,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日书事五首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"十年骑马听朝鸡，老窃州符簿领迷。\n衙鼓不闻春睡足，闭门聊喜得幽栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22805,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞溪绝句三首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"溪流直傍长堤去，缭乱半山桃李花。\n极知渡口好春色，却下扁舟步晚沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22806,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞溪绝句三首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"杏花无数连村落，也有人家挂酒旗。\n春色撩人只供醉，却怕风吹易醒时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22807,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞溪绝句三首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"桃李欲开天雨雪，二月山城无奈寒。\n赖尔狐裘来送质，更须樽酒放愁宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22808,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿玉虚宫小轩正对步虚峰道士云天宝三年有庆云见且山呼万岁始诏建黄帝祠封为仙都山敕书今亡 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"封禅空馀不死名，华清宫里望长生。\n閒云强作人间瑞，更有山呼万岁声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22809,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿玉虚宫小轩正对步虚峰道士云天宝三年有庆云见且山呼万岁始诏建黄帝祠封为仙都山敕书今亡 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"龙虎驱驰战阪泉，荆山鼎就更升天。\n轩辕到处存遗迹，忍使君王不学仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22810,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜宿玉虚宫小轩正对步虚峰道士云天宝三年有庆云见且山呼万岁始诏建黄帝祠封为仙都山敕书今亡 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"槛外风高霜月明，步虚山里步虚声。\n罢琴刻烛初长夜，又得人间一梦清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22811,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其十","author":"韩元吉","text":"闭户跏趺意已清，炉香烧尽一灯明。\n空庭叶落知多少，一任西风百种声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22812,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其九","author":"韩元吉","text":"江南四百八十寺，未抵西湖胜处多。\n不用楼台带烟雨，只看宫殿压晴波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22813,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其八","author":"韩元吉","text":"塞草初黄边马肥，边尘莫便向南飞。\n江头鹤唳秋风起，看取阴山六骑归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22814,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其七","author":"韩元吉","text":"八月涛头旧有名，今年潮浅岸才平。\n应缘享帝千灵在，豫使鱼龙不敢鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22815,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其六","author":"韩元吉","text":"右手持杯左不空，蟹螯已作雪蒙茸。\n秋风莫起鲈鱼梦，未似先生阿堵中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22816,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其五","author":"韩元吉","text":"城外秋荷一半黄，尚馀疏柳照回塘。\n江南底许风光好，塞雁来时未有霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22817,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"何许砧声清梦回，丁东犹作佩环猜。\n卷帘风露凉如水，端为嫦娥向此来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22818,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"小雨惊秋滴夜阑，晴云和日晓斑斑。\n谁怜客舍尘埃底，犹得西湖一两山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22819,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"酒熟橙黄盛物华，重阳无客不思家。\n鹅儿剪雪开岩桂，鹤羽攒金散菊花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22820,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋怀十首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"朝行佛屋鱼千里，暮借僧床鹩一枝。\n窗下秋虫解人意，似怜羁客伴哦诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22821,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种竹","author":"韩元吉","text":"香苞吹尽翠成围，墙角萧萧一径微。\n已喜轩窗无俗韵，更怜风月有清辉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22822,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺子忱抱膝庵二首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"红覆薰笼锦不如，万株相倚占春馀。\n小窗睡足花阴里，何似天香下玉除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22823,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贺子忱抱膝庵二首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"紫橐光华稳致身，会看功业上麒麟。\n丈人久误人间世，莫忘他年蕙帐春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22824,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送沈信臣赴试南宫五首 其五","author":"韩元吉","text":"吾谋不用可无人，小技文章亦有神。\n一第区区儿戏耳，请君折取桂为薪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22825,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送沈信臣赴试南宫五首 其四","author":"韩元吉","text":"漫仕虽同官事殊，故人来往未全疏。\n因君时一论文字，难我穷年困簿书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22826,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送沈信臣赴试南宫五首 其三","author":"韩元吉","text":"共踏槐花记昔年，一弯新月夜移船。\n君行为问灵泉水，梦到松林石壁前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22827,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送沈信臣赴试南宫五首 其二","author":"韩元吉","text":"仆射吴兴自世家，乃翁勋业著金华。\n似闻玉座询名字，会伏青蒲掌白麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22828,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送沈信臣赴试南宫五首 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"山城寒陟夜飞霜，枫叶青红带夕阳。\n夹道梅花有春色，不妨冲雪到钱塘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22829,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重午斋宿读蔡迨文编以酒馈之 其一","author":"韩元吉","text":"长安米贱不难居，玉署金闺有直庐。\n指日君王嗟见晚，凌云谁似马相如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":22830,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]